{"pageWidth":585,"pageHeight":783,"items":[{"text":"CLINICAL STATEMENTS","rect":[8.57,631.5866,19.57,713.9150000000004],"fontSize":11},{"text":"AND GUIDELINES","rect":[19.57,641.7935,30.57,703.7180000000004],"fontSize":11},{"text":"e352","rect":[49.5,24.712999999999997,67.66,32.712999999999994],"fontSize":8},{"text":"August 2026","rect":[79.66,24.712999999999997,124.32400000000001,32.712999999999994],"fontSize":8},{"text":"Stroke.","rect":[293.6873,24.712999999999997,317.2393,32.712999999999994],"fontSize":8},{"text":"2026;57:e316–e436. DOI: 10.1161/STR.0000000000000513","rect":[319.40729999999996,24.712999999999997,535.5016999999998,32.712999999999994],"fontSize":8},{"text":"Prabhakaran et al","rect":[49.5,749.74,108.35600000000002,757.74],"fontSize":8},{"text":"2026 Acute Ischemic Stroke Guideline","rect":[405.828,749.74,535.4992,757.74],"fontSize":8},{"text":"Knowledge Gaps and Future Research","rect":[49.5,710.8334,237.37679999999997,722.8334],"fontSize":12},{"text":"•","rect":[49.5,695.2733999999999,52.83,705.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"The exact BP targets in the hyperacute setting and","rect":[59.5,695.2733999999999,283.4910000000002,705.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"before thrombolysis or thrombectomy to improve func","rect":[59.5,683.2733999999999,279.96900000000005,693.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[279.96,683.2733999999999,283.5,693.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"tional outcomes among patients with ischemic stroke","rect":[59.5,671.2733999999999,283.5,681.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"are unclear. RCTs are needed that evaluate not only","rect":[59.5,659.2733999999999,283.5000000000001,669.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"BP lowering but also BP augmentation, particularly","rect":[59.5,647.2733999999999,283.52,657.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"among those with LVO.","rect":[59.5,635.2733999999999,155.159,645.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"•","rect":[49.5,623.2733999999999,52.83,633.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"In a post-hoc evaluation of RCT data used as an obser","rect":[59.5,623.2733999999999,280.13000000000017,633.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[279.9601,623.2733999999999,283.50010000000003,633.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"vational cohort, it was shown that smaller SBP variability","rect":[59.50010000000003,611.2733999999999,283.5301000000001,621.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"over the first 24 hours postalteplase is associated with a","rect":[59.50010000000003,599.2733999999999,283.47010000000023,609.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"favorable shift of the mRS score; however, the effective","rect":[59.50010000000003,587.2733999999999,280.1301000000002,597.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[279.9601,587.2733999999999,283.50010000000003,597.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"ness of targeting BP variability is not well-established.","rect":[59.50010000000003,575.2733999999999,272.7101000000001,585.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"33","rect":[272.5066,579.5208,279.18778,585.3508],"fontSize":5.83},{"text":"•","rect":[49.5,563.2733999999999,52.83,573.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Trials assessing individualized BP targets based on","rect":[59.5,563.2733999999999,283.4990000000001,573.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"cerebral perfusion or other biomarkers should also be","rect":[59.5,551.2733999999999,283.525,561.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"considered to assess whether BP lowering or aug","rect":[59.5,539.2733999999999,279.9400000000001,549.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[279.96,539.2733999999999,283.5,549.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"mentation is appropriate in specific subgroups (eg,","rect":[59.5,527.2733999999999,283.5040000000001,537.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"poor reperfusion post-EVT requiring higher targets).","rect":[59.5,515.2733999999999,274.7900000000001,525.2733999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"•","rect":[49.5,503.27340000000004,52.83,513.2734],"fontSize":10},{"text":"There is a dearth of data on BP management in pedi","rect":[59.5,503.27340000000004,279.95000000000016,513.2734],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[279.9601,503.27340000000004,283.50010000000003,513.2734],"fontSize":10},{"text":"atric patients with AIS; optimal BP targets have not","rect":[59.50010000000003,491.27340000000004,283.4981000000001,501.27340000000004],"fontSize":10},{"text":"been studied in children.","rect":[59.50010000000003,479.27340000000004,160.56910000000005,489.27340000000004],"fontSize":10},{"text":"4.4. Temperature Management","rect":[49.5,447.83340000000004,197.7408,459.83340000000004],"fontSize":12},{"text":"Recommendations for Temperature Management","rect":[53.75,430.7512,218.08129999999989,437.7512],"fontSize":7},{"text":"Referenced studies that support the recommendations are","rect":[53.75,421.7492,248.98699999999985,428.7492],"fontSize":7},{"text":"summarized in the","rect":[53.75,412.74719999999996,115.87500000000001,419.74719999999996],"fontSize":7},{"text":"online data supplement","rect":[117.772,412.74719999999996,196.949,419.74719999999996],"fontSize":7},{"text":".","rect":[196.949,412.74719999999996,198.405,419.74719999999996],"fontSize":7},{"text":"COR","rect":[59.469,399.4962,74.785,406.4962],"fontSize":7},{"text":"LOE","rect":[95.267,399.4962,108.987,406.4962],"fontSize":7},{"text":"Recommendations","rect":[123.75,399.4962,186.596,406.4962],"fontSize":7},{"text":"1","rect":[65.16,368.2482,69.094,375.2482],"fontSize":7},{"text":"B-R","rect":[95.93199999999999,368.2482,108.32199999999999,375.2482],"fontSize":7},{"text":"1.","rect":[123.75,386.2512,129.434,393.2512],"fontSize":7},{"text":"In patients with AIS who have hyperthermia,","rect":[131.331,386.2512,261.13829999999996,393.2512],"fontSize":7},{"text":"targeting normothermia, including using nurse-","rect":[131.3308,377.2512,269.1608,384.2512],"fontSize":7},{"text":"initiated protocols for managing fever, is recom","rect":[131.3308,368.2492,270.04139999999995,375.2492],"fontSize":7},{"text":"-","rect":[270.0413999999999,368.2492,272.0853999999999,375.2492],"fontSize":7},{"text":"mended for improving functional outcomes and","rect":[131.3308,359.24719999999996,270.9108,366.24719999999996],"fontSize":7},{"text":"reducing death.","rect":[131.3308,350.24519999999995,177.7058,357.24519999999995],"fontSize":7},{"text":"1–3","rect":[177.7053,353.22438,184.84296899999998,357.30538],"fontSize":4.081},{"text":"1","rect":[65.158,328.0012,69.092,335.0012],"fontSize":7},{"text":"C-EO","rect":[93.375,328.0012,110.882,335.0012],"fontSize":7},{"text":"2.","rect":[123.75,337.0012,129.434,344.0012],"fontSize":7},{"text":"In patients with AIS and hyperthermia, sources of","rect":[131.331,337.0012,277.04229999999995,344.0012],"fontSize":7},{"text":"hyperthermia, such as infection, should be identi","rect":[131.3308,328.0012,274.11609999999996,335.0012],"fontSize":7},{"text":"-","rect":[274.1160999999999,328.0012,276.1600999999999,335.0012],"fontSize":7},{"text":"fied and treated to avoid complications.","rect":[131.3308,318.9992,248.14679999999998,325.9992],"fontSize":7},{"text":"3: No","rect":[58.44680000000001,296.7462,75.79980000000002,303.7462],"fontSize":7},{"text":"Benefit","rect":[54.87680000000001,287.7442,79.36980000000001,294.7442],"fontSize":7},{"text":"B-R","rect":[95.9248,292.24519999999995,108.3148,299.24519999999995],"fontSize":7},{"text":"3.","rect":[123.75,305.7512,129.434,312.7512],"fontSize":7},{"text":"In patients with AIS and normothermia, treatment","rect":[131.331,305.7512,276.3283,312.7512],"fontSize":7},{"text":"with induced hypothermia or prophylactic fever","rect":[131.3308,296.7512,270.02880000000005,303.7512],"fontSize":7},{"text":"prevention is not recommended for the purpose","rect":[131.3308,287.7492,272.6748,294.7492],"fontSize":7},{"text":"of improving outcomes.","rect":[131.3308,278.74719999999996,200.6098,285.74719999999996],"fontSize":7},{"text":"4–7","rect":[200.6089,281.72438,207.493547,285.80538],"fontSize":4.081},{"text":"Synopsis","rect":[49.5,255.46620000000001,89.9,265.4662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"In patients with AIS with hyperthermia, achieving normo","rect":[49.5,243.46620000000001,279.98000000000013,253.46620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[279.96,243.46620000000001,283.5,253.46620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"thermia, including using nurse-driven protocols to moni","rect":[49.5,231.46620000000001,279.96000000000004,241.46620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[279.96,231.46620000000001,283.5,241.46620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"tor for and treat temperatures","rect":[49.5,219.46620000000001,174.99000000000007,229.46620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":">","rect":[178.1496,220.2962,183.8191,228.7962],"fontSize":8.5},{"text":"37.5°C improves clinical","rect":[183.819,219.46620000000001,283.509,229.46620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"outcomes and reduces mortality.","rect":[49.498999999999995,207.46620000000001,185.019,217.46620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"1–3","rect":[185.021,211.71359999999999,195.21767,217.5436],"fontSize":5.83},{"text":"For those with fever,","rect":[198.3675,207.46620000000001,283.4975,217.46620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"rapidly identifying and treating the cause can improve","rect":[49.4975,195.46620000000001,283.52250000000004,205.46620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"outcomes. RCTs have demonstrated that induced hypo","rect":[49.4975,183.46620000000001,279.9375000000001,193.46620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[279.9575,183.46620000000001,283.4975,193.46620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"thermia does not improve outcomes and may increase","rect":[49.4975,171.46620000000001,283.5075000000001,181.46620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"adverse events.","rect":[49.4975,159.46620000000001,113.6875,169.46620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Recommendation-Specific Supportive Text","rect":[49.4975,140.96620000000001,239.92550000000006,150.96620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"1.","rect":[59.6,128.96620000000001,67.1,138.96620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"In several RCTs and large observational studies","rect":[74,128.96620000000001,283.51,138.96620000000001],"fontSize":10},{"text":"collectively","rect":[74,116.9662,118.99,126.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"including","rect":[125.11,116.9662,162.4,126.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"several","rect":[168.52000000000004,116.9662,197.90000000000003,126.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"thousand","rect":[204.02000000000007,116.9662,242.57000000000005,126.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"patients,","rect":[248.6900000000001,116.9662,283.4900000000001,126.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"high body temperatures in the early in-hospital","rect":[74,104.9662,283.50900000000007,114.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"phase of stroke care have been associated with","rect":[74,92.9662,283.5100000000001,102.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"worse functional outcomes and increased mortal","rect":[74,80.9662,279.98,90.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[279.96000000000004,80.9662,283.50000000000006,90.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"ity, compared with normothermia.","rect":[74.00000000000003,68.9662,215.25000000000006,78.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"1–3","rect":[215.2528,73.2136,225.44947000000002,79.0436],"fontSize":5.83},{"text":"Nurse-driven","rect":[229.7393,68.9662,283.4993,78.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"protocols to monitor and treat fever are supported","rect":[73.9993,56.9662,283.4893,66.9662],"fontSize":10},{"text":"by RCT evidence that demonstrate improved short-","rect":[325.9993,713.3562,535.4893000000002,723.3562],"fontSize":10},{"text":"and long-term outcomes, including mortality.","rect":[325.9993,701.3562,508.9573,711.3562],"fontSize":10},{"text":"5","rect":[508.9575,705.6074,512.35639,711.4374],"fontSize":5.83},{"text":"2.","rect":[311.6,689.3598999999999,318.95000000000005,699.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Although central hyperthermia can occur, it is a","rect":[326,689.3598999999999,535.4900000000011,699.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"relatively","rect":[326,677.3598999999999,360.9000000000002,687.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"uncommon","rect":[367.69000000000017,677.3598999999999,412.9000000000003,687.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"source","rect":[419.6900000000002,677.3598999999999,447.07000000000033,687.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"of","rect":[453.8600000000003,677.3598999999999,462.0500000000003,687.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"hyperthermia","rect":[468.8400000000003,677.3598999999999,521.5800000000006,687.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"in","rect":[528.3700000000006,677.3598999999999,535.5100000000006,687.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"patients with AIS compared with concurrent infec","rect":[326,665.3598999999999,532.1200000000011,675.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[531.96,665.3598999999999,535.5,675.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"tion.","rect":[326,653.3598999999999,342.4900000000001,663.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"8","rect":[342.3397,657.6074,345.73859,663.4374],"fontSize":5.83},{"text":"Patients with AIS and concurrent infection","rect":[351.2011,653.3598999999999,535.482100000001,663.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"have worse outcomes compared with those without","rect":[326.0011,641.3598999999999,535.5011000000012,651.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"infection.","rect":[326.0011,629.3598999999999,361.96110000000016,639.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"9,10","rect":[361.8095,633.6074,372.71743000000004,639.4374],"fontSize":5.83},{"text":"The source of infection should be rapidly","rect":[374.80379999999997,629.3598999999999,535.4998000000007,639.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"identified and treated to avoid further complications","rect":[325.9998,617.3598999999999,535.4898000000012,627.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"and worsening of outcomes of patients with AIS.","rect":[325.9998,605.3598999999999,520.829800000001,615.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"3.","rect":[311.6001,593.3598999999999,319.1001,603.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"To","rect":[326.0001,593.3598999999999,335.39009999999996,603.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"date,","rect":[341.5501,593.3598999999999,361.5601,603.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"studies","rect":[367.7201,593.3598999999999,397.5101,603.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"of","rect":[403.67009999999993,593.3598999999999,412.0100999999999,603.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"hypothermia","rect":[418.17009999999993,593.3598999999999,469.4300999999999,603.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"in","rect":[475.59009999999984,593.3598999999999,482.88009999999986,603.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"normother","rect":[489.0400999999998,593.3598999999999,531.9800999999998,603.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[531.9602,593.3598999999999,535.5002,603.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"mic patients with AIS, including a large phase III","rect":[326.00019999999995,581.3598999999999,535.5191999999998,591.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"trial of prophylactic hypothermia,","rect":[326.00019999999995,569.3598999999999,463.73019999999997,579.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"3","rect":[463.74,573.6074,467.13889,579.4374],"fontSize":5.83},{"text":"have shown no","rect":[470.8888,569.3598999999999,535.4888,579.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"benefit in functional outcomes, including among","rect":[325.99879999999996,557.3598999999999,535.4988000000001,567.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"patients with large infarcts undergoing decom","rect":[325.99879999999996,545.3598999999999,531.9388000000001,555.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[531.9588,545.3598999999999,535.4988,555.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"pressive hemicraniectomy.","rect":[325.99879999999996,533.3598999999999,435.0337999999999,543.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"8","rect":[435.0345,537.6074,438.43339,543.4374],"fontSize":5.83},{"text":"Some studies suggest","rect":[441.6234,533.3598999999999,535.5083999999999,543.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"that induction of hypothermia increases the risk of","rect":[326.0034,521.3598999999999,535.5033999999999,531.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"adverse events.","rect":[326.0034,509.3599,390.28340000000003,519.3598999999999],"fontSize":10},{"text":"4,6","rect":[390.2755,513.6074,398.04689,519.4374],"fontSize":5.83},{"text":"Various cooling methods, includ","rect":[400.8467,509.36,531.9767,519.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[531.9567,509.36,535.4966999999999,519.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"ing","rect":[325.9966999999999,497.36,338.7066999999999,507.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"intravascular,","rect":[345.0816999999999,497.36,398.6416999999999,507.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"surface,","rect":[405.01669999999984,497.36,437.7366999999998,507.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"and","rect":[444.1116999999998,497.36,459.53169999999983,507.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"pharmacological,","rect":[465.91169999999977,497.36,535.5016999999998,507.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"have been studied without clear evidence of ben","rect":[325.9966999999999,485.36,531.9587,495.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[531.9586999999998,485.36,535.4986999999998,495.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"efit of any modality. The limitations of these studies","rect":[325.9966999999999,473.36,535.5107,483.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"include adverse events with prolonged hypother","rect":[325.9966999999999,461.36,531.9467000000001,471.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"-","rect":[531.9567,461.36,535.4966999999999,471.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"mia, limited observational study sample size, and","rect":[325.9966999999999,449.36,535.4967,459.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"exclusion of pediatric patients.","rect":[325.9966999999999,437.36,451.6466999999999,447.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Knowledge Gaps and Future Directions","rect":[301.5001,413.92,493.1893,425.92],"fontSize":12},{"text":"•","rect":[301.5001,398.36,304.83009999999996,408.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Various cooling methods in various populations with","rect":[311.5001,398.36,535.5201,408.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"acute stroke have been studied without clear benefit.","rect":[311.5001,386.36,535.4901000000002,396.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"Further resource allocation to studying temperature","rect":[311.5001,374.36,535.5201000000001,384.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"management in AIS is not currently warranted.","rect":[311.5001,362.36,504.0590999999999,372.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"•","rect":[301.5001,350.36,304.83009999999996,360.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"The benefits of ultrafast and selective intraarterial","rect":[311.5001,350.36,535.5201000000002,360.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"brain cooling remain unknown. Potential benefits of","rect":[311.5001,338.36,535.4901,348.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"these cooling techniques may be specific to stroke","rect":[311.5001,326.36,535.5200999999998,336.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"subpopulations and require further study.","rect":[311.5001,314.36,480.9281,324.36],"fontSize":10},{"text":"4.5. Blood Glucose Management","rect":[301.5001,290.92,460.30330000000004,302.92],"fontSize":12},{"text":"Recommendations for Blood Glucose Management","rect":[305.7501,273.83779999999996,476.94209999999987,280.83779999999996],"fontSize":7},{"text":"Referenced studies that support the recommendations are","rect":[305.7501,264.83579999999995,500.9870999999998,271.83579999999995],"fontSize":7},{"text":"summarized in the","rect":[305.7501,255.83379999999997,367.8751,262.8338],"fontSize":7},{"text":"online data supplement","rect":[369.77209999999997,255.83379999999997,448.94909999999993,262.8338],"fontSize":7},{"text":".","rect":[448.94910000000004,255.83379999999997,450.40510000000006,262.8338],"fontSize":7},{"text":"COR","rect":[311.